      "text": "iD editor embed\n\nStage, never upload.\nApproved OSM edits load the\nlive element, compare versions,\nand place the exact tag diff in\niD's undo history.\n\n(P0-last, deferred)",
      "rawText": "iD editor embed\n\nStage, never upload.\nApproved OSM edits load the\nlive element, compare versions,\nand place the exact tag diff in\niD's undo history.\n\n(P0-last, deferred)",
